            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.8.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 8.38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Erega ubutumwa bwiza ntibunkoza isoni: kuko ari imbaraga y'Imana ihesha uwizera wese gukizwa, uhereye ku Muyuda ukageza ku Mugiriki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAB.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hab 2.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kuko muri bwo ari na mo gukiranuka kuva ku Mana guhishurirwa, guheshwa no kwizera kugakomezwa na ko, nk'uko byanditswe ngo “Ukiranuka azabeshwaho no kwizera!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ubuhenebere bwatewe no kwimura Imana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umujinya w'Imana uhishurwa uva mu ijuru, ubyukirijwe ubugome",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "ubyukirijwe ubugome:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "cyangwa, ubyukijwe n'ubugome.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " no gukiranirwa by'abantu byose, bashikamiza ukuri gukiranirwa kwabo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko bigaragara ko bazi Imana, Imana ikaba ari yo ubwayo yabahishuriye ubwo bwenge, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko ibitaboneka byayo ari byo bubasha bwayo buhoraho n'ubumana bwayo, bigaragara neza uhereye ku kuremwa kw'isi, bigaragazwa n'ibyo yaremye kugira ngo batagira icyo kwireguza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.4.17+EPH.4.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ef 4.17-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kuko ubwo bamenye Imana batayubahirije nk'Imana, habe no kuyishima, ahubwo bahinduka abībwira ibitagira umumaro, maze imitima yabo y'ibirimarima icura umwijima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bīyise abanyabwenge bahinduka abapfu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.16+DEU.4.17+DEU.4.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guteg 4.16-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " maze ubwiza bw'Imana idapfa babuhindura ibishushanyo by'abantu bapfa, n'iby'ibiguruka, n'iby'ibigenza amaguru ane, n'iby'ibikururuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
