              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni cyo cyatumye Imana ibareka ngo bakurikize ibyo imitima yabo irarikiye, bakor ibiteye isoni bononane imibiri yabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.24",
