        },
        {
          "text": "Ni cyo cyatumye Imana ibarekera kurarikira ibyonona, ndetse bigeza ubwo abagore babo bakoresha imibiri yabo uburyo bunyuranye n'ubwo yaremewe. ",
          "type": "text",
