              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buzuye gukiranirwa kose n'ububi, no kurarikira n'igomwa, buzuye n'ishyari n'ubwicanyi, n'intonganya n'ubugambanyi no gukina ku mubyimba, no gusebaniriza mu byongorerano, ",
          "type": "text",
